| 10–18 | Price board + speak-aloud | Handover flow + QR | Seed price data | Integrate model into app | Build first APK, test on device | Conduct field research |
| 18–24 | Earnings ledger | Dashboard polish | API polish | Anomaly detection + TTS | Camera/Geolocation Capacitor plugins | Unit-economics slide |
| 24–28 | Multilingual pass | Bug fixes | Bug fixes | Accuracy tuning | Airplane-mode full test pass | Pitch deck build |
| 28–32 | Safety guidance content | Bug fixes | Bug fixes | Fallback UI polish | Final APK rebuild + bug fixes | Demo script written |
| 32–35 | — | — | — | — | Final device check | Full team rehearsal |
| 35–36 | Buffer/sleep | Buffer/sleep | Buffer/sleep | Buffer/sleep | Buffer/sleep | Buffer/sleep |

