## Key Reminder for Demo Day
Your single strongest moment: put the phone in **airplane mode**, create a lot, classify
a material with the on-device AI, complete a handover — all with zero internet — then
turn Wi-Fi back on and show it sync. That one sequence proves every "offline-first" and
"entry-level Android" requirement in the PS in under 60 seconds.
